  "job_B15.8.467_20260920_210339": {
    "chunk_text": "\u00c6rest to Dumeltun eastan on Esingburnan. \u00d0anon su\u00f0an on Esingburnan westweardes andlang dices. \u00d0\u00e6t swa up on gerihte on Dagan oran. \u00d0\u00e6t swa andlang st\u00e6\u00f0broces in gem\u00e6re dic. \u00d0\u00e6t swa andlang on secgm\u00e6re. \u00d0\u00e6t swa of secgm\u00e6re estrihte in Esingburnan on Dyrna ford. \u00d0onne sindon \u00f0is \u00f0a gem\u00e6re \u00e6t Pidwyllan. Of Pidwellan on crundelu. Of crundelum su\u00f0rihte andlang hricges on tittan dune. Of tittan dune west on cealdan wyllan. \u00d0anon on Winterburnan. Swa on Pidwyllan. Of Pidwyllan on Eom\u00e6res m\u00e6dwe. And swa on o\u00f0erne Winterburnan. \u00d0\u00e6t on Pidwellan. And \u00f0eder hyr\u00f0 inn an haga on port. And swa andlang Pidwellan up o\u00f0 crundelu..",
